# ZevSafe AI Agent Rules

CRITICAL: Whenever you modify, add, refactor, or delete ANY file or code in this repository:
1. Update `CHANGELOG.md` with the new changes under the appropriate version.
2. Update `change-log/index.html` to mirror the changelog on the live web portal.
3. Update `README.md` (version badge, current stable release banner, features table).
4. Synchronize `sw.js` (APP_VERSION) and `index.html` (WEB-VERSION badge) if app files were modified.
5. Verify all tests pass: `node test/test-android-encryption.js` and `node test/test-integration-m5.js`.
